00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:52.510
- [Narrator] Even raw chicken.

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:55.420
- Can somebody say salmonella.

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:58.650
- I have never gotten sick
from meeting raw meat, ever.

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:01.080
And I've been doing it for six years now.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.610
- It just takes one
time to get really sick,

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:05.410
to get ICU hospitalized,

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.860
to potentially get a colitis so bad

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:09.520
that you need a colon resection

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:11.560
and then need to wear a colostomy bag

00:10:11.560 --> 00:10:12.393
to realize that,

00:10:12.393 --> 00:10:13.740
"Wow, I probably shouldn't
have been doing that."

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:15.960
I'm as a doctor, can't tell
this person what to do,

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:17.630
nor should I tell this person what to do,

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.440
nor should I judge what
this person is doing.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:21.630
But what I can do is tell them the risks

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:22.710
of what I just said,

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:25.090
and then see like, are those
risks acceptable to you?

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:26.220
And if so, why?

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:27.530
And if the person is cognizant

00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:30.120
and they can understand and
accept those risks, that's it.

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:32.040
- [J.J. Virgin] You do have a parasite.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:34.330
- So this looks like they gave him an ova

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:38.050
and parasite test of his stool sample

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:39.680
and they saw that there's a parasite.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:40.890
But they didn't do a taxonomy.

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:42.900
So they don't know what
kind of parasite it is.

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.160
And it very clearly states there

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:46.040
that there's no treatment
that's even necessary

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.380
if the patient doesn't have symptoms

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:48.780
or other inflammatory markers.

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:50.070
That's an important note there.

00:10:50.070 --> 00:10:51.640
Something else I wanna point out

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:53.410
is if you eat under
cooked meats quite often,

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:55.650
you put yourself at a risk
of developing a tapeworm.

00:10:55.650 --> 00:11:00.310
Undercooked pork can lead
to a cyst forming parasite

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:03.610
that can actually lay cysts in your brain.

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:06.530
You're risking all these
things for no real benefit.

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:08.000
Like just cook your meat, somewhat.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.890
- One more thing that's
of interest on this test,

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:15.890
rotting protein that hasn't
digested sitting in your gut.

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:18.210
(error message sound)

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:20.620
- They need to stop ordering these tests

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:21.840
that mean absolutely nothing.

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:24.380
Like this show is so ridiculous.

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:26.120
My God.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.910
I've actually went vegan and keto before.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:30.410
Click here to check out those videos

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.060
and learn about those diets

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:33.840
and as always stay happy and healthy.

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:35.140
Which one you clicking on?

00:11:36.086 --> 00:11:38.669
